:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)]].''
'''Sanosuke Sagara''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 747
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sanosuke Sagara
|name2 = Sanosuke Sagara CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sanosuke Sagara CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sanosuke Sagara is an extremely tanky Uber against zombies sporting decent piercing range, akin to that of [[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Kat-A-Pult]], albeit with no blindspot and less piercing range. His midrange nature means he serves as a second line of defense, being able to hold the line if zombies ever push past your defenses. However, he suffers from a few problems, most notably his mediocre damage without the Savage Blow accounted into and his long cooldown for a tanker.

Despite being on the lowest-end of the Ubers in his set, he still stands out as a decent pick for players that lack anti-zombie firepower.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Midranger}}

